  "id": "openmindedness",
  "term": "openmindedness",
  "definition": "Openmindedness is an individual tendency to be receptive to new information when evaluating evidence and making decisions. In this research context, it is treated as one of the factors linked to how adults engage with scientific information in everyday life.",
